      "blocks": {
        "faq_question_8JwDzC": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Magnesium is vital for maintaining overall health, as it supports hundreds of biochemical reactions in the body, including regulating blood pressure, maintaining heart health, and aiding in energy metabolism.</p>",
            "title": "Why do I need magnesium?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_UnWAet": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Absolutely, Magnesium is formulated with high-quality ingredients and is safe for daily use.</p>",
            "title": "Is Magnesium safe to use every day?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_XEUxDm": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Most users experience noticeable benefits within a few days to a week of consistent use.</p>",
            "title": "How quickly can I expect to see results?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_cRxrPB": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Men need about 450–500mg per day, while women need around 300–350mg.</p>",
            "title": "What’s the recommended dose?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_dxbtWR": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Magnesium is an essential mineral that plays a crucial role in various bodily functions, including muscle and nerve function, energy production, and bone health.</p>",
            "title": "What is magnesium?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_hq8jbX": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Yes, Magnesium offers a superior blend of magnesium compounds for optimal absorption and effectiveness.</p>",
            "title": "Can Magnesium replace my current magnesium supplement?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_pgefYt": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Signs of magnesium deficiency may include muscle cramps, fatigue, weakness, headaches, trouble falling asleep, mood swings, and more.</p>",
            "title": "What are the signs of magnesium deficiency?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_wFpAdL": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Magnesium is well-tolerated by most individuals and has no side effects reported.</p>",
            "title": "Does Magnesium have any side effects?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_y3ekpF": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Yes, Magnesium works with other Arrae products and can be safely combined for more health benefits.</p>",
            "title": "Can I take Magnesium with other Arrae products?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        }
      },
